  {
    "episode_id": 49431,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/9/49431.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 25,
    "turn_text": "I want to make sure that people understand that they have this congressional office and their corner on this, that our job is to hear from you and try to help. And there are many ways in which we do that. One is, as I've been discussing, pushing the president for 100% declaration, pushing the local agencies for 100% or to be responsive. But we will also go to bat for you on your individual claims. There was, for example, a family whose claim was denied. We found out about it. We went back to FEMA and they got about $40,000, which is the limit that FEMA can give if you've lost your home. So we will go to bat for you for your individual claims. We are what I often say, the WD-40 for you, right? We're never where he kind of understand that right away. WD-40, we can unstick things. I can't make the decision. I don't have any money to give you. I'm going to say, oh, here's your approved but what I can do and what our amazing staff does it's really they do it and I get to get credit for all the great work my staff does is they will be on it with FEMA they will be on it with USDA so call us reach out to to our office we're your can of WD-40 your personal can of WD-40 the number is 505 4, 2, 8, 4, 6, 8, 0. And then let us know about these other big issues so we can brainstorm together. I truly believe that New Mexico, Northern New Mexico, our land, our ability to utilize our land in a way that heals our planet is key. And I want to make sure that we bring the resources that are available to do that here. And that's why we got the World Partners Network in Northern New Mexico because I have been raising this issue. since I got to DC. I've been raising the issue of our world communities. And that led to them saying, let's put one of these pilot projects in northern New Mexico. It also helped that we have our wonderful Secretary, Sochi, thought it small. But we're here for you. We're in your corner. Give us a call.",
